 "codigo": "CL028",
 "parte": 1,
 "titulo": "The day ten suns rose at once ☀️ Part 1 #mythology #shorts",
 "capa": "TEN SUNS AT ONCE",
 "descripcion": "In Chinese myth, ten suns took turns crossing the sky. One day, they all rose together, and the earth began to burn.\n\nSource: Huainanzi (2nd century BC), chapter 8.\n\nWhat would you have done?\n\n#mythology #chinesemythology #change #houyi #shorts",
 "lineas": [
  {
   "texto": "In the oldest Chinese myths, there were ten suns.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "They were the sons of the sun goddess, Xihe.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "They lived in a giant tree in the east, and took turns.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "Each morning, their mother bathed one, and sent him across the sky.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "One sun a day crossed the sky. Then, one morning, all ten rose.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "Maybe they were bored. Maybe they wanted to play together.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "Rivers dried. Crops burned. The earth cracked open.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "Monsters came out of the hills, hungry and wild.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "People hid in caves, and prayed for night.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "The emperor called the greatest archer alive. His name was Hou Yi.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "His arrows never missed. He had a red bow, and white arrows.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "First, he only tried to scare them. They burned brighter.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "He climbed a mountain, and drew his bow.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "The air shimmered. His hands were hot on the string.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "One arrow. One sun fell from the sky.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "Where it fell, there was only a golden crow, with three legs.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "The other suns went quiet.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "But how many would he leave? Part two, {when_next}.",
   "pausa": 0.3
  }
 ],
